            <ArticleTitle>Small bowel occlusion due to intussusception of a single metastasis of lung cancer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>833-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The occurrence of small bowel intussusception due to metastatic lung cancer is very infrequent. We present a case of young man recently diagnosed of non small cell lung cancer that had a unique small intestine metastasis. We discuss the diagnostic and therapeutic issues.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
